2 CONC (11 Des ?) * BURIAL: (Eide Flahammer/Fladhammer)  Father: Giert Christophersøn MORGENSTIERNE Mother: Birgitte Christophersdatter GLAD  Family 1 : Birgitte ANDERSDATTER  * MARRIAGE: 1653  1.  Vilchen Christophersøn MORGENSTIERNE  F
