2 CONT
2 CONT Katrina married Torbjorn Anveson Osa, son of Anve Torbjrnson Osa and Jorond Torsteinsdatter, in 1714.432 (Torbjorn Anveson Osa was born in 1672 in Ulvik, Hardanger, Hordaland and died in 1728 in Osa, Hardanger, Hordaland.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Katrina next married Per Jonsson Vestrheim, son of Jon Olsson Vestrheim and Marta Larsdatter Granvin, in 1730.433 (Per Jonsson Vestrheim was born in 1696 and died in 1780.)
