2 CONT
2 CONT 7. Maria Christophersdatter Munthe, f. 1724, 1725.
2 CONT
2 CONT 8. Gerhard Christophersen Munthe, f. 9 mars 1726, d. 28 april 1785.
2 CONT
2 CONT 9. Maria Christophersdatter Munthe, f. 1727,
2 CONT
2 CONT 10. Anna Christophersdatter Munthe, f. Okt. 1728, d. 18 des. 1794.
2 CONT
2 CONT Christopher var sogneprest.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mer info kommer......1)
