2 CONT * Ektefelle 2: http://home.no.net/mikegl/fam02234.htm + http://www.myheritage.no/person-1008430_70251941_70251941/jean-von-der-lippe + http://www.vonderlippe.org/Index_-english-/Downloads/downloads.html PEFVDL.zip s. 49 
2 CONT * Familie 2: http://www.myheritage.no/person-1008430_70251941_70251941/jean-von-der-lippe + http://www.vonderlippe.org/Index_-english-/Downloads/downloads.html PEFVDL.zip s. 49 & 53 
2 CONT * Begravelse: http://www.vonderlippe.org/Index_-english-/Downloads/downloads.html PEFVDL.zip s. 49  https://gw.geneanet.org/brynjulf?lang=no&pz=tor&nz=langballe&ocz=0&p=jean&n=von+der+lippe
