1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 26sep2021 NOTE: In 1711, enkjem. Ove Kristiansen "hadde 9 barn".  We know he had 5 sons and we have 2 datter noted here, for a total of 7.  Who were the other 2?
2 CONT
2 CONT * s.48 Saga um Jolst: "the danish name Ove that came to Jolst with fendrikjen Ove Kristianson, at Berg, lived and the naem appears at Sygnesand (1718) and Orset (1724)."  Ove died in 1718.  
2 CONT * s.45: "the highest military man in Jolst was fendrikjan Ove Kristian, ein tilflutt sunnmoring"
2 CONT * s.46: "Barbera Bugge (datter to presten Daniel B.), born 1676, g.m. officeren Ove Kristiansen Berg (30jul1702)
2 CONT * s.47: Baptised Names: Ove fendrik paa Berg --- 1715, 1724, something about a Maren, Marete, Marte
2 CONT * s.70: 1699: fendrikjin Ove paa Bjorset, Barbara Bugge --- maybe a card or letter?
2 CONT * s.76: 1690: Jolst had fendriken Ove Kristian og lensmannen Jens Nerbo og Torleiv Kjosnes
2 CONT * s.89: 1705: Sandnes: Ove Kristian and drinking with caperalen Nils Berg, drunk, half drunk…can't make out details well.
2 CONT * s.99: Ordalen: some property sold to fendriken Ove Bjorset
2 CONT * s.130: Helgheim 1708: fendriken Ove Kristian, g.m. Maren Madsdtr Finde
2 CONT * s.629: Indre Berg 1682: fendrik Ove Kristian crafted probate 1691 after Torgeir Hansen to ekja Kristi Andersdtr
2 CONT ** Why was Ove involved?  Did he have a son with Kristi Andersdtr that they named Anders (Ovesen) and was in Sognesand in 1718 with his father?
2 CONT ** Notes that Kristi Andersdatter was bror til Anders Andersen Jesdalin
2 CONT * s.679/680: Nerbo, Nov1704 skifte etter lensmann Jens Nilsen Nerbo: 6dl til fendrikjen Ove Kristian paa Berg…
2 CONT * s.694: Ovrebo, 1706: fendriken Ove paa Bjorset stemnde Anders Andersson for 4 dalars skuld…. 
2 CONT * s.616: Svidalen, 1791 skifte etter Anne Andersdatter, mentions her siblings:
2 CONT ** Jorand Andersson, Bergen
2 CONT ** Ove Kristian Andersson (dod ~ 20 years earlier -> d~1771) --- notes he had 4 barn
2 CONT ** Krispines (died 14aar?)
2 CONT * s.729/730 Bjorset: Ove Kristiansen (f~1653, d.1718), g1.m.  Barbra Danielsdtr Bjorset (Bugge, d~1711), g~1712, 2m. Torborg Kristoffersdtr
2 CONT ** Sons: Samel (dobt 1699) and Soren (dobt 24jan1697) Ovesen
2 CONT ** 1711: secondlieut. Ekkjem. Ove Kristianson hadde 9 barn!
2 CONT ** 1710: became fendrik
2 CONT ** 1701 karfolktel: Ove Christian (48 -> f~1653), 5 sons:  Danjel (15aar -> f~1686), Lodvik (14), Kristjan (7), Soren (4), Samel (2)
2 CONT ** He must have married again 1712 or after because he was enkjem. 1712 and had an ekja in 1719 after he died.
2 CONT * s.728 Bjorset: speculation that Ove Kristiansen could have been named after the Danish kings Fredrik and Kristian.
2 CONT ** Einar Haarstad suggested that Ove Kristiansen came from Syvden, Sunnmor.  However, that Ove Kristiansen cannot be the same as fendrik Ove given the conflicts.
