2 CONT
2 CONT Hans was the son of [http://www.geni.com/people/Erik-Leganger/6000000002893822470 Erik Iversen Leganger] and [http://www.geni.com/people/Maren-Leganger/6000000001169124844 Maren Agnete Hansdatter Schreuder].
