2 CONC //www.vonderlippe.org/Index_-english-/Downloads/downloads.html PEFVDL.zip s. 46
2 CONT * Familie: http://home.no.net/mikegl/fam02235.htm + http://www.myheritage.com/research/collection-1/myheritage-family-trees?itemId=141447881-5-7704&action=showRecord&indId=externalindividual-9816c94bc49b752ccfd346a6b990ffa8&mrid=c
